```\
\
Sometimes Sway execs things in a way that inherits the working directory of whatever process loaded the config. If your Sway config is being reloaded from `~/.config/sway/`, child processes can sometimes inherit that path.\
\
**A quick workaround in the meantime** â€ƒ´ you can force Kitty to always start in your home directory by adding this to `~/.config/kitty/kitty.conf`:\
```\
